   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.32,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Those are perfect for a slight speed boost. Many apps also trim silences automatically, which helps without sounding rushed.",
